  "description": "Winspace M6 105 Di2 — Performance Carbon Road Bike\n\nThe M6 is Winspace's flagship carbon road bike, engineered for riders who demand aerodynamic efficiency and precise electronic shifting. Equipped with Shimano 105 Di2, the M6 delivers seamless, reliable gear changes in any condition.\n\nKey Features\n\nFull Carbon Aero Frame — Optimized in wind tunnel testing for maximum speed with minimal drag\n\nShimano 105 Di2 Electronic Groupset — Precise, effortless shifting at the touch of a button\n\nHydraulic Disc Brakes — Consistent stopping power in all weather conditions\n\nLightweight Construction — High-modulus carbon fiber for an exceptional stiffness-to-weight ratio\n\nIntegrated Cable Routing — Clean aesthetics and reduced aerodynamic drag\n\nBuilt for Competition\n\nWhether you're racing crits, gran fondos, or pushing your personal best on a fast road, the M6 105 Di2 is engineered to keep up with your ambitions. Every detail — from the tube shaping to the component spec — is chosen to maximize your performance on the road.",
